{"unit_id":"tag:02L8:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。记<MATH_0003>及<MATH_0004>，后者是<MATH_0005>的基变换（base change）。再以<MATH_0006>表示给定的平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）。假设每个<MATH_0007>都是拟紧（quasi-compact）浸入（immersion）。由概形（Schemes），引理<REF_0001>，每个<MATH_0008>都是分离（separated）的。由引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>，可知<MATH_0009>是拟紧（quasi-compact）且分离（separated）的。设<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>经过其概形（scheme）论像（image）的分解。由态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0004>，闭子概形（closed subscheme）<MATH_0012>由拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals）<MATH_0013>定义，因为<MATH_0014>是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。由平坦（flat）基变换（base change）（例如见概形上同调（Cohomology of Schemes），引理<REF_0005>；这里用到<MATH_0015>是分离（separated）的），可知<MATH_0016>是拉回（pullback）<MATH_0017>。因此，<MATH_0018>由拟凝聚理想层（quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals）<MATH_0019>定义。由态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0006>，态射（morphisms）<MATH_0020>是开浸入（open immersions）。于是由引理<REF_0007>可知<MATH_0021>是开浸入（open immersion），从而<MATH_0022>是浸入（immersion），正如所需（我们已经知道它是拟紧（quasi-compact）的）。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"closed subscheme","target_term":"闭子概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf of ideals","target_term":"拟凝聚理想层"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term"